# Heirs of one class, each held alone in a field, meet at one `new`. Every caller of their constructors is known, and the call has several callees. To mention such a constructor is to mention the members of its class, and a member that nobody calls waits in a cycle: so the constructor waits in its own cycle too, and is not in the queue from the start. The build used to stop here.
